      ],
      "source": "https://michigan4you.com/history-of-indian-river-michigan-1900s-tourism/"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Indian River hosts the National Shrine of the Cross in the Woods, an open‑air sanctuary honoring Native American saint Kateri Tekakwitha.",
